kern.
=====

Idk why i called it that it was 3am and i needed sleep.

!! WARNING !!
Kern is being rewritten at the moment. To see the last version before the rewrite, see commit 11feab5 on master.
(https://github.com/Tom-on64/kern/tree/11feab5)

About
-----
Kern is a 32-bit OS based on the x86 architecture written in NASM Assembly and C. 
It attempts to be a µ-kernel, although i have no clue what i'm doing.

Dependencies
------------
* binutils that can target i386-elf
* sfdisk
* GCC that can target i386-elf
* Limine
* make
* Mtools
* NASM

Old Version: https://github.com/Tom-on64/old-kern

